*.pyc
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# Synced from camdl repo — regenerated by make sync
# Tracked so CI can render without the camdl repo

/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Large fit results (reproducible from configs)
examples/fitting/results/
examples/fitting_archive_*/

# Scratch HTML reports
fitting_diagnostic.html
fitting_review.html
guide/fitting_diagnostic.html

# boarding-school-sir-clean chapter: fitting CAS dirs + run transcripts
# (reproducible from .toml + data/in_bed.tsv; not source)
boarding-school-sir-clean/results/
boarding-school-sir-clean/output/fits/
boarding-school-sir-clean/output/synth_data/
boarding-school-sir-clean/output/synth_fits/
boarding-school-sir-clean/test_procnoise/results/
boarding-school-sir-clean/test_procnoise/holdout/results/
boarding-school-sir-clean/test_procnoise/holdout_rising/results/
boarding-school-sir-clean/*.log
boarding-school-sir-clean/**/*.log
# Pre-merge safety snapshot — regenerated on demand, never committed
boarding-school-sir-clean/_v1_snapshot/
# Rendered HTML (source is the .qmd)
boarding-school-sir-clean/*.html
# Upstream-bound working copy (canonical lives in camdl/docs/dev/proposals/)
prequential-proposal.md

# Derivative caches — reproducible from the chapter's scripts, not source:
# - PPC / sloppy-axis / synthetic simulations (reproducible via `camdl simulate`
#   or the chapter's trajectory_*.py / sloppy_axis.py / sbc.py)
boarding-school-sir-clean/output/ppc_*.tsv
boarding-school-sir-clean/output/synthetic_ppc.tsv
boarding-school-sir-clean/output/sloppy_k_*.tsv
boarding-school-sir-clean/output/smoothing_paths.tsv
# - NPZ profile caches (binary numpy; the .tsv profile outputs from `camdl
#   profile` are tracked and human-readable)
boarding-school-sir-clean/output/*.npz
# - Prequential traces with per-particle samples (regenerated by `camdl pfilter
#   --save-prequential` invocations in model_comparison.qmd)
boarding-school-sir-clean/test_procnoise/preq/*.json

# Transmission-trees chapter: lineage artifacts regenerated at render time
guide/transmission-trees/results/
